  BuffTools - CLEAN BUILD (no link to the original author)

  Derived from "BuffTools" by landie123zxc (Bee Swarm Simulator HUD, v2.7.196). The public loader was decoded and
  everything that talked to the author's infrastructure was taken out:
    * community leaderboard / stats upload to the author's Discord webhook ..... removed
    * auto-update ("Reload from GitHub", Session.url, notes.json) .............. removed
    * icon + sound downloads from the author's GitHub repo ..................... removed (local files only)
    * author-hosted artwork URLs inside the optional personal webhook .......... removed
  This script makes NO network requests of its own. The only outgoing request that can exist is the optional
  webhook to YOUR OWN Discord channel: getgenv().BuffToolsWebhook = "<your webhook url>" (empty by default).

  It runs fully standalone. Optional extras (icon/sound pack, leaderboard) live in BuffTools_owner_link.lua.
  Icons: workspace/BuffTools/icons_r2/<name>.png     Sounds: workspace/BuffTools/sounds/<name>.mp3
  Missing icons are replaced by text badges (BT / SET / ID / SS ...) and the tiles' own glyphs.
